        "TileImage": "$($repository 9cb860cd-1cf5-4476-97c7-0cc7cf7a4315).Image",
        "Description": "Diana Penelope Burnwood is the deuteragonist of the HITMAN series. As one of the former handlers at the International Contract Agency (also known as the Agency, or ICA), she provided Agent 47 with clients, targets, and information. She went Freelance with 47 after they both destroyed Providence and 47 exposed the ICA to the world. The pair collectively (assassin and handler) now operate a murder-for-hire service by themselves with no ties to the ICA.",
